OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after car crashes into
OL,4,Asupermarket
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 30s has died after a car
OL,7,Fcrashed into a Lidl shop in
OL,8,FWolverhampton.
OL,10,FPolice were called to the supermarket
OL,11,Fin Finchfield Hill shortly before 18:00
OL,12,FBST on Friday.
OL,14,FWest Midlands Police said the man was
OL,15,Fpronounced dead at the scene and a
OL,16,Fnumber of other people were treated for
OL,17,Finjuries.
OL,19,FWest Midlands Fire Service said it
OL,20,Fdispatched four crews to the incident
OL,21,Fat 17:51 BST with two crews still at
OL,22,Fthe scene at 20:05 BST.
